boxes-and-lines AWS Account
// stress: nesting — groups four deep: account, VPC, subnet, service (#1840)

[Production Account]
  [VPC]
    [Public Subnet]
      [Edge]
        Load Balancer
        Gateway
    [Private Subnet]
      [App Tier]
        API
        Worker
      [Data Tier]
        DB
        Cache

Load Balancer -> API
Gateway -> API
API -> DB
API -> Cache
Worker -> DB
